---
Add track color customization.

Allow users to set a custom color for each track, used in the drum grid,
mixer, and piano roll.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Right-click track header opens color picker
- [ ] 8-16 preset colors available
- [ ] Selected color used for track's grid cells, mixer strip, piano roll notes
- [ ] Track colors saved/loaded with project

## Test Plan
- [ ] Right-click track, select color, verify grid cells change color
- [ ] Save project, reload, verify colors preserved
- [ ] Verify color appears in mixer and piano roll
